*> cp037 to ASCII by table. Counts translated bytes outside 0x20-0x7E.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EBCXLATE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY EBCDIC037.
01 WS-I PIC 9(3) COMP-5.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-IN PIC X(120).
01 LK-OUT PIC X(120).
01 LK-N PIC 9(3).
01 LK-NONMAP PIC 9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-IN LK-OUT LK-N LK-NONMAP.
MAIN-PARA.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-NONMAP
    MOVE SPACES TO LK-OUT
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > LK-N
        MOVE EBC-TABLE(FUNCTION ORD(LK-IN(WS-I:1)):1) TO LK-OUT(WS-I:1)
        IF LK-OUT(WS-I:1) < SPACE OR LK-OUT(WS-I:1) > "~"
            ADD 1 TO LK-NONMAP
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.
